{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1794497015,"nonce":"ayz/G12pcBRraPTpQW4Hr+GLAz0=","message":"Landed on `roadmap-190c308-integration` (fcda810..a1242ef).\n\n**Changes**\n- Cargo.toml: iced features tokio, image and canvas; new direct dep `image` (png)\n- Cargo.lock: updated for new deps; `profiling` pinned to 1.0.17 because the index had no profiling-procmacros 1.0.18\n- src/main.rs: `iced::application(App::boot, App::update, App::view)` with `.theme`, `.subscription`, 1100x800 window\n- src/lib.rs: exports `demo` and `ui`\n- src/ui/mod.rs: `Screen`, `App`, `Message`; boot opens `Store` at `default_db_path()` and loads `Settings`; update/view/theme/subscription; 6 update tests\n- src/ui/header.rs: header with app name, ☀/☾/System theme segmented control, ES/EN toggle, History and Settings nav\n- src/ui/snap.rs: `DevEnv` reads `MAEVE_DEMO`, `MAEVE_THEME`, `MAEVE_LANG`, `MAEVE_SCREEN` and `MAEVE_SNAPSHOT`; `save_png`; 4 tests\n- src/demo.rs: `demo_comparison()` with ML 16 GB (USD) vs TEMU 12 GB mini PCs, realistic ES text, plus 1 test\n- src/theme/styles.rs, src/theme/mod.rs: new `header`, `segmented` and `segment` styles, exported\n- src/i18n.rs: `NavHistory` and `NavSettings` keys, ES/EN\n- scripts/snap.sh: builds once, writes `target/snaps/{light,dark}-{es,en}[-screen].png`, optional screen arg\n\n**Gates:** fmt ok · clippy ok · tests ok · scraper-tests n/a\n**Review:** 1 findings — 0 auto, 1 by hand, 2 deferred\n- Window title is set once from `Lang::Es` in `main.rs` and does not follow language switching. Low severity, cosmetic.\n- A settings change made before `Booted` arrives is overwritten by the loaded settings (milliseconds window). Low severity, negligible.\n\n**Decisions**\n- Acceptance: the 4 PNGs were read in light/dark and es/en, and the `settings` screen set was also produced. The header uses `card` background, `border`, primary-tinted active nav and the muted segmented track, so it matches the theme tokens in both modes.\n- Scan found no issues. By hand I fixed a harness hang it noted: `TakeSnapshot` now exits when `window::latest()` yields no window.\n- `SetThemePref(System)` re-queries `system::theme()` because `theme_changes()` is only subscribed while the pref is System. This keeps `system_mode` fresh when switching back to System.\n- Added `MAEVE_SCREEN` (compare|history|settings) beyond the four env vars in the task, to back the `snap.sh` screen arg.\n- Added `Booted`, `Saved` and `TakeSnapshot` messages beyond the plan's `Message` interface. `Booted` carries `Option\u003cStoreHandle\u003e` (Debug newtype over `Arc\u003cStore\u003e`) and `Box\u003cSettings\u003e`.\n- Dev env overrides apply to in-memory `Settings` only. A toggle used while `MAEVE_THEME` or `MAEVE_LANG` is set would persist the override. Dev only.\n- The `image` dep is set to `default-features = false, features = [\"png\"]`, but iced's `image` feature enables `image/default` anyway, so the extra codecs still build.\n- The body is a placeholder card (screen title plus the demo verdict). Input, results, history and settings content come in later layers.\n- Update tests assert the \"save task\" via `Task::units()` (1 with a tempfile `Store`, 0 without).","files":null}]}